        <div class="featured__meta">
          <div class="featured__meta-avatar">
            <img src="/blog/images/steven-headshot.png" alt="Steven"
              onerror="this.style.display='none';">
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Steven Wagner</strong> · April 2025 · 12 min read
          </div>
          <a class="featured__read" href="/blog/why-emails-go-to-spam">Read article →</a>
        </div>
